      "description": "Raises, approves and receives purchase orders org-wide; maintains suppliers and inventory (including stock adjustments); reads warehouses. Accepts and cancels customer orders \u2014 the stock-commitment and stock-release steps \u2014 on top of the ordinary counter work every Operations user does. Does not create or rename warehouses \u2014 that stays with the admin.",
